# Corpus-specific exclusions — copy to collection_registry.local.txt and edit.
#
# This file is gitignored. It names volumes in *your* output/ directory, so it
# means nothing in anyone else's clone. The shared rules in
# collection_registry.txt cover directories the pipeline generates by
# convention; this covers judgements about particular material.
#
# Same format: <verb> <glob> <category> [# note]
# Loaded after the shared file, so `include` here overrides an `exclude` there.

# Manuscript material — pipeline tests, not directories. Handwriting and sparse
# layouts give these alignment and OCR profiles nothing like a printed
# directory's, so averaging them into a corpus figure describes neither.
# exclude  copyright_ledgers_*            manuscript-test
# exclude  frederick_douglass_papers_*    manuscript-test

# Genres tried once. "deferred" rather than "rejected" when you may return:
# flipping the line to `include` brings them back.
# exclude  *language_of_flowers*          deferred

# Carve one volume out of a shared rule:
# include  ia_trow_1907_trowsgen          promoted to production
